            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Endometriosis is a growing healthcare problem all around the world. I discuss in this article how the hungarian healthcare system is working and helping patients suffering from endometriosis. I discuss all diagnostic and therapeutic possibilities which are available for the patients. I discuss also some data from my own practice, 181 patients suffering from chronic pelvic pain caused by endometriosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
